    "text": "Consider the kinetic data given in the following table for the reaction <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Product.<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Experiment No.</td>\t\t\t<td><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Rate of reaction <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>6.0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>6.0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1.2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>9.0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br />The rate of the reaction for <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0.15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0.15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is found to be <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> The value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> is __________",
